# Project structure

Follow `.agents/skills/project-structure/SKILL.md`.

Hard rules:

- kebab-case **files and folders** (except Nuxt-reserved names); PascalCase **component exports**
- Screens in `app/pages/`; chrome in `app/layouts/` via `definePageMeta`
- Optional feature shell: `app/components/feature-a/shell.vue` — skip when UI diverges (`feature-b`)
- All Vue + recipe kernel under `app/` (`~/` / `@/`); no top-level `src/`
